!/packages/*/src
# **Hand-written measurement fixtures, not build output** (P18A-16). The M-3
# size baselines are authored `.js`/`.d.ts` by necessity — baseline A assembles
# a slot record by hand and baseline B is a different package — so the blanket
# rules above made one of D-77's own measurements, and the test that keeps the
# baseline honest against `assemble()`, unreproducible from a clean clone.
!/packages/*/bench/**/*.js
!/packages/*/bench/**/*.d.ts

